        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Things we find out in Villains &nbsp;<strong>Copy this quick before a mod deletes it!</strong></p><p>Legacy didn&#39;t like peas until he was 22.</p><p>Unity has a pet Raptor Bot that she won&#39;t take into battle, she calls it Charlie, it loves to hide in Bunkers unused suits.</p><p>La Capitan for a short while went under the title Maria the Mariner, which she ditched after they traded Ken Griffey Jr.</p><p>Miss Information similarly played around with the name Innacurate Data, but no one took her menacing letters to the editor seriously.</p><p>Baron Blade keeps trying to destroy the Freedom Tower because, &quot;It looks hideous, it doesn&#39;t fit the skyline at all, I mean doesn&#39;t Megalopolis have a city planners office?&quot;</p><p>The Chairman disagrees with this assessment, and is actually a big fan of the tower&#39;s design.</p><p>Chrono Ranger isn&#39;t actually a time-traveller, he made up the story and pretends to talk to Con all the time to hide that he&#39;s listenning to Smooth Jazz during battles.</p><p>Expatriette doesn&#39;t like kittens, but she thinks Turtles are the cutest things ever.</p><p>Tachyon may be the fastest woman on Earth, but she&#39;s never placed higher than third at interplanetaries.</p><p>The government continues to refuse permits for Tachyon to build a big ramp that would let her build up speed and &quot;Run to Mars&quot;, a decision Tachyon claims could save weeks off the time it takes to communicate with Wagner Mars Base.</p>",
